Package: hpgR
Title: Companion Package for P8149 Human Population Genetics
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Gao", "Wang", email = "wang.gao@columbia.edu",
                 role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Companion functions for P8149 Human Population Genetics at
    Columbia University Mailman School of Public Health. Established models
    and methods are implemented in R through ports and rewrites of functions
    from Daniel Nachun's popgentools R collections and Bo Peng's simuPOP. 
    Small examples and standard probability calculations are also provided to
    support learning and interpretation of basic concepts.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils, parallel
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), jsonlite
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
